msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/auth/basic/LDAP/basic_ldap_auth.8:284
msgid ""
"If you want to search for the user DN and your directory does not allow "
"anonymous searches then you must also use the B<-D> and B<-w> flags to "
